@startuml
title One drawing, three readings — Workflow v2, statecharts, and TOGL
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFAF8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #54413A
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #A55B30
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #8A6D5C
}

package "The canvas — one drawing" as Canvas #FFF1DD {
  component "nodes, edges,\ncontainers" as Drawing #FFE0B2
}

package "Structural reading — TOGL (graphl term)" as TOGL #D7EAF8 {
  component "Nominate\n<latex>\mathsf{let}\;x=v\;\mathsf{in}\;g</latex>" as Nom #EAF5FF
  component "Connection\n<latex>\langle\mathsf{let}\ldots,\mathsf{let}\ldots\rangle</latex>" as Conn #EAF5FF
  component "Juxtaposition\n<latex>g\otimes h</latex> (Tensor)" as Tens #EAF5FF
  component "Cut / Subgraph\n<latex>\mathsf{let}\;A=g_1\;\mathsf{in}\;g_2</latex>" as Cut #EAF5FF
  component "Well-formedness\n<latex>\mathsf{G}[X,V];\Gamma\vdash g</latex>" as WF #BEE5CF
}

package "Executable reading — statechart (v2 definition)" as SC #E3D8F5 {
  component "States and\ntransitions\n(triggers, guards,\npriorities, bounds)" as Trans #F0E8FA
  component "Scopes, regions,\nhistory" as Scopes #F0E8FA
  component "Joins and\nfork epochs" as Joins #F0E8FA
  component "Publish validation\n(progress boundaries,\nreference safety)" as Valid #BEE5CF
}

Drawing --> Nom : node admission\n(Context payload = kind/config)
Drawing --> Conn : edge
Drawing --> Tens : side-by-side structure
Drawing --> Cut : deploy-container\n(one level today)
Drawing --> Trans : Configure transition
Drawing --> Scopes : scope fields
Drawing --> Joins : Configure fan-in

WF ..> Valid : same predicate, two strategies:\nderived during construction vs.\nchecked at publish

note bottom of TOGL #EAF7EE
Structure only: edges are unlabeled
reference pairs. graphl implements this
column constructor-for-constructor
(F1R3FLY-io/graphl-parser).
end note

note bottom of SC #EAF7EE
Dynamics only: dispositions, routing,
counters <latex>\kappa_c(e) < b_e</latex>, joins, history.
Normative in the statechart semantics
and operational semantics documents.
end note

note right of Canvas #FFF6C9
Saved as BOTH serializations in one
record (queries.ts): the TOGL term for
structure, the v2 definition for
dynamics. Nothing yet checks their
coherence — proposal 1 of the
correspondence document.
end note
@enduml
